{"id":"ausserhalb","lemma":"außerhalb","pos":"adv","rank":1302,"glosses":["outside, beyond","outside","out of town"],"ipa":"/ˈaʊ̯sɐhalp/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/10/De-au%C3%9Ferhalb.ogg/De-au%C3%9Ferhalb.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Er lebt außerhalb der Stadt.","en":"He lives outside the city.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"a state in which…","l":"Leben"},null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"city"}]},{"text":"Meine Eltern leben außerhalb der Stadt.","en":"My parents live outside the city.","words":[{"g":"my","l":"mein"},{"g":"parents"},{"g":"a state in which…"},null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"city"}]},{"text":"Wir essen oft außerhalb.","en":"We eat out a lot.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to eat"},{"g":"often"},null]},{"text":"Warte bitte außerhalb des Hauses!","en":"Please wait outside the house.","words":[{"g":"to wait","l":"warten"},{"g":"please"},null,{"g":"of the","l":"der"},{"g":"house, building","l":"Haus"}]},{"text":"Was machst du außerhalb des Bettes?","en":"What are you doing out of bed?","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"to make","l":"machen"},{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"of the","l":"der"},{"g":"bed (piece of furniture","l":"Bett"}]}]}